  (vector "90-docs/adr/2607121000-cloud-itonami-global-isic-isco-reverse-toposort-plan.edn（ISCO occupation-actor track の全体計画、Wave3: production/trades、92xx/96xx elementary-occupations subgroup の最終バッチ）"
   "https://github.com/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-isco-9212（直接の参照実装、elementary-occupation outdoor-labour ハザードパターンの原典）"
